WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
(soft music)

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.820
- Did you see him?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.980
- I saw a oneness, a unity of things,

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.540
I was a plant and an ant

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.000
- No, but did you see him?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.990
- I saw that there is
love and we are all a part

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.210
of that love like that, you mean?

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.880
- No an old man with a beard

00:00:22.994 --> 00:00:24.233
and he shimmies.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.158
And when he speaks his
voice booms, like thunder.

00:00:29.158 --> 00:00:33.370
- I didn't see that, I saw shining light.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:37.323
- Yes an old man and his
heart pours forth light.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.863
- No, just light.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.683
But I saw love.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.664
And I see your love for God.

00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:57.140
And for me, which I never saw before

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.870
and I have disrespected it.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.860
- Perhaps we are each guilty of that.

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.020
- We are fighters.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:08.023
- Perhaps that hides the
truth of us both at times.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.233
- They love God, my people,

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.543
you showed me that, thank you.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.480
But their thinking
should not be controlled

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.063
by these ancient terrors.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.830
There's a modern world Archie,

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.130
your church could be part of it.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:33.390
- God wants me to serve you,

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.300
it's strange and at times inexplicable.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.040
- Together, we would be formidable,

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.933
we could be the grit that
makes the pearl for each other.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.560
And I need you, you know them

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.393
and you truly love them.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.793
I will not kill you.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.713
- You have seen the
light, even if not God.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.943
- Now, how do we get
rid of this crocodile?

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.970
You must've had a plan.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.290
- I had faith God would
provide one when the time came.

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.990
- Not really a plan though, is it?

